{
 "about": "Kingdom v5, the short run a script can check: two nights of 26 seconds, days of 34. The script picks up the ten starting coins, recruits two citizens, makes one the builder and one an archer, builds the wooden wall, waits through the first night (two single Greed: the archer's arrows), collects the morning's four coins, recruits again and puts a farmer on the field, waits through the second night (bursts of 2, 2 and 1) and wins at the second dawn. Prints to expect, in order: KG_READY, KG_DAY, KG_COINS 1..10, KG_CITIZEN x2, KG_BUILDER, KG_ARCHER, KG_WALL 1, KG_WARN, KG_DUSK 1, KG_GREED x2, KG_ARROW/KG_SHOT/KG_KILL, KG_DAWN, KG_INCOME 4, KG_COINS, KG_CITIZEN, KG_FARMER, KG_WARN, KG_DUSK 2, KG_GREED x3, KG_ARROW..., KG_WALL_HIT, KG_DAWN, KG_VICTORY. KG_POOR / KG_NEED mean a station refused. Whether it is fun is for a person to say; this run only shows that every part works. The full game is kg5_play.json: day 60, night 45, five nights. An option shows no text on an account of 奇匠 level 1, only its icon, so prices are rows of small coins above the stations.",
